<h4 id=3D"u-net">U-Net</h4>
<p>U-Net [14] is a convolutional neural network (CNN) architecture original=
ly developed for biomedical image segmentation. It consists of a series of =
downsampling blocks followed by upsampling blocks, as shown in Figure 8.</p=
>
