together and labeled 'Downsampling bl...'.  Following the downsampling bloc=
ks, a series of light-green boxes labeled 'U' represent upsampling blocks, =
also connected sequentially with arrows.  An ellipsis (...) again indicates=
 repetition of the 'U' blocks.  These upsampling blocks are grouped and lab=
eled 'Upsampling bloc...'.  A dashed line connects the top block to the dow=
