cess</figcaption></div></figure>
<h4 id=3D"backward-process">Backward process</h4>
<p>In the backward process, also known as the <strong>denoising process</st=
rong>, an ML model learns to reverse the forward process. At each step, the=
 model predicts the noise in the noisy image. This predicted noise is then =
used to reduce the noise in the input image. As shown in Figure 13, this pr=
ocess is repeated until the image becomes clear.</p>
